From: Project Luma <builds@project-luma.local>
Subject: [PATCH] luma: Present MessageTray notifications in the Studio lip

Downstream GNOME Shell 50.3; upstream GPL-2.0-or-later. New bundled
Lucide glyphs retain ISC/MIT provenance in ProjectLuma source register.

